Package: mpsim
Architecture: any
Section: electronics
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: MPARM system simulator
 MPARM - Multiprocessor ARM. It is a modular simulation of an entire
 system-on-chip written in C++. It is cycle accurate, and models the
 datapath at the bus level. It is sufficiently complete that it will
 run microcontroller linux and rtems.

